msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Freedom"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Turn your people into the ultimate riders. Focus on mobile tactics with "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCOUT_UNIT.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"CAVALRY_GROUP.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@AUTHOR@NAME"
msgstr "Imani Balewa, remnant of the old Azracs"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@AUTHOR@DESC"
msgstr ""
"\"Just as it was hard to say precisely when the summer came to an end and "
"when autumn fully took hold, my journey did not come to close in one time in "
"one place. There were, rather, many endings, and later many new beginnings.\""

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@Name"
msgstr "Steppe Rider"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@DESC"
msgstr ""
"A {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SCOUT_UNIT.Hyperlink} that specializes in commanding "
"other cavalry units."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@Unit@Skill"
msgstr "Nomad Wits 2"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@Unit@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"This unit is boosting the efficiency of all cavalry in it's stack: "
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+15% Evasion. [bullet/]+15% Extra damage vs {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.RANGED_UNIT.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BATTLE_MAGE."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"This unit is a master skirmisher, excelling in fighting ranged toe to toe."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@Unit@Skill2"
msgstr "Warrior of the Steppes"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill1@Unit"
msgstr "Introduce"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill2@Name"
msgstr "Thoroughbred Mounts"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill2@SKILL@Name"
msgstr "Windborn Charge"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill2@DESC"
msgstr ""
"By utilizing our superior mounts, our riders now can perform engagements "
"that leave no room for retaliation: [bulletlist][bullet/]Add {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.THOROUGHBRED_MOUNTS_CHARGE.Hyperlink} to all {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"CAVALRY_GROUP.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill3@Name"
msgstr "Resilient People"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill3@Skill@Name"
msgstr "Resilient People"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill3@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"I live with only the wind following on my back. [bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+1{GLOBAL.StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL."
"HitPointConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill3@Desc"
msgstr ""
"Your people's culture evolved from nomads and wanderers, making them "
"exceptionally resillient: [bulletlist] [bullet/]+1{GLOBAL."
"StatusResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.HitPointConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill2@Unit@Skill@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Charge with the speed of the winds, once hit: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Regain "
"all 3 {GLOBAL.ActionPointConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Disable all offensive "
"skills for 1 turn. [bullet/]Disable all {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept."
"Hyperlink} for 1 turn."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill4@Name"
msgstr "Flying Wedge"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill4@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Friendly units in a 1-hex radius gain for 1 turn: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Add "
"Displace and Replace to all {GLOBAL.ChargeConcept.Hyperlink} attacks. "
"[bullet/]Gain {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.HASTENED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill5@Name"
msgstr "Freedom Sworn"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill5@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Introduce the free tribes living in your borders to your {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"SCOUT_UNIT.Hyperlink} retinue, mounted Scouts gain: [bulletlist] [bullet/]A "
"regular {GLOBAL.MeleeConcept.Hyperlink} Strike. [bullet/]+4 {GLOBAL."
"RangedConcept.Hyperlink} {GLOBAL.PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill6@Name"
msgstr "Winds! Follow me"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill6@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Gather the full might of the Great Sky and {GLOBAL.ChargeConcept.Hyperlink} "
"forward: [bulletlist] [bullet/]Deals Damage in a 1-hex radius "
"[bullet/]Displace all units around the target."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@Skill6@Group"
msgstr "Tome of Freedom Hero Group"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@DEBUFF@DESC"
msgstr ""
"All attacks and {GLOBAL.DefenseModeConcept.Hyperlink}. are blocked due to "
"Windborn Charge effect."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@DEBUFF@NAME"
msgstr "Faster than the Wind"

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@SPI@DESC"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist] [bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} if placed on Snow, "
"Desert or Ashlands. [bullet/]+4 {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink} per "
"Adjacent {GLOBAL.HutConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL."
"ResearchPostConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME@MOUNTS@SPI@NAME"
msgstr "[unitprod/] Nomadic Gathering"

msgid "TOME@MONT@PANTHEON@NAME"
msgstr "Ascension: Sky's Champion"

msgid "TOME@MONT@PANTHEON@NAME2"
msgstr "1"

msgid "TOME@MONT@PANTHEON@NAME3"
msgstr "2"

msgid "TOME@MONT@PANTHEON@NAME4"
msgstr "3"

msgid "TOME@MONT@PANTHEON@NAME5"
msgstr "4"
